#X text 12 8 ym2612~ - YM2612-style 4-op FM voice (one chip channel);
#X text 12 28 LEFT inlet: pitch + params. float = midi note. note <midi> [vel] = key on. note <midi> 0 = key off (release). RIGHT inlet: gate \, applies to the channel of the most recent voice message (ch1 if none);
