#X msg 12 884 bank gm-old.wopn;
#X text 300 692 all nine are bundled with the app (extracted to the pd search path). Your own .wopn works too: put it next to a patch or on the search path. After loading \, `gm <1-128>` reads the new table. Per-preset transpose comes from the file's note offsets;
